# R8 rules for the minified release build.
#
# Verified 2026-09-09 (#260 item 2): R8 DOES read this path. A deliberately
# unparseable directive here failed :app:minifyReleaseWithR8 with
# 'Unknown option', naming this file and line. The AGP 9 keepRules source-set
# convention is wired; rules added here will take effect.

# No rules are needed today, and the file stays to prove the path is live (see
# above). The block that used to be here was seven -dontwarn lines for the
# annotation types Tink referenced without bundling -- the transitive dependency
# of androidx.security:security-crypto. #457 removed that library, so the
# warnings have no source and the lines went with it. Room ships its own rules;
# the Keystore and javax.crypto classes are platform code R8 never shrinks away.
